<p>Marriage date confirmed by family Bible record. A marriage license has reportedly been seen but is not currently located; documentary confirmation of the license itself is pending.</p>

<p>John and Mary Jane had three children together: Serena, Charley, and Ottis. All three died within their first year of life, per birth records and the family Bible.</p>

<p>John abandoned Mary Jane sometime after 1867. She remarried, under the surname Puckett, had additional children, and died 17 Feb 1905, per her Find a Grave memorial.</p>